      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "时代不断地在变化。\n──接下来的“大阪杯”，\n是个古马级强者云集的大舞台！",
      "source_fingerprint": "059421630b870ba72e4726a030c7ef55f08b50b25b16bdf3b9057128613d6f35",
